      <main class="main-content layout-2-col clearfix clear" role="main"><div class="breadcrumb-container clearfix clear"><nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="breadcrumb"><a href='https://www.landofbasketball.com/'>Home</a> > <a href='../../nba_records.htm'>Records and Stats</a> > Finals Lost</nav></div><h1 class="tc-1">NBA Teams With the Most Finals Lost</h1>
<p class="tc-2">Which teams have lost the most NBA Finals and the full list of teams that reached that stage in the Playoffs, ordered by Finals lost.</p>
<div class="hr-4"></div>
<div class="clearfix clear a-right pad-r2 margen-t3 margen-b8" style="line-height: 1.8;"><strong>More about Finals</strong>: 
	<a href="../../stats_teams/finals/finals_played.htm">Played</a>
 -
	<a href="../../stats_teams/finals/finals_won.htm">Won</a>
 -
Lost -
<span class="nowrap">	<a href="../../stats_teams/finals/finals_winning_perc.htm">Winning %</a>
</span>	
</div><div class="clearfix clear overflow-x-auto a-center max-0 margen-t10 margen-b15 bb-1 d-flex flex-wrap">
	<div class="rd-100-60">
	  <div class="linea-1 clearfix clear overflow-x-auto no-1-block"></div>
	  <div class="clearfix clear margen-y10 margen-r10 margen-l5">
	  <h2 class="margen-b3"><strong>Which team has lost the most NBA Finals?</strong></h2>	  
	  <p class=" margen-b0">The <strong>Los Angeles Lakers</strong> are the team with the most Finals lost in NBA history with 15 losses in the Championship series. That means that they have been the team that lost in 18.8% of a total of <a href='../../championships/year_by_year.htm'>80 NBA Finals</a>. <strong>On the positive side</strong> the Lakers have been present in 32 NBA Finals and have won the title  17 times.</p>
	  </div>   
	</div>  
	<div class="rd-100-40 color-4 color-neu" style="min-height: 80px;">
	  <h3 class="t-enc-1  pad-2 margen-t0">Most NBA Finals Lost</h3>
	  <p class="margen-t10 margen-b3 margen-x5 pad-b10">
	   <span class="size-13 negri">15 finals</span><br>
		 Los Angeles Lakers</p>
	</div>
</div>
<p class="margen-y10 ">In 80 editions of the NBA Playoffs, a total of <strong>28 teams</strong>  have reached the Finals at least once, most of them (23) lost at least once, 20 of them lost twice or more and only 5 of them lost 5 championships series or more. Here you can see the full list of these teams ordered by Finals lost.</p>
<div class="clear"></div>
